			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ζωστήρ</span> (a place on the west coast
			of Attica), 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ζωστήριος Ἀπόλλων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					12.324.70
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Euph.
				95b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Paus.
				1.31.1
			</span></i>, cf.foreg.IV. <i><span class="en">
