				Hsch.
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-στειρα</span> cod.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀθηνᾶ ζωστῆρα</span> (sic) <i><span class="en">
